  unitName: Ramia
  unitId: 20071
  unitNumber: 89
  description: Magic beings that are half woman, half snake. It is rumored their
    bodies attract men lost at sea. When a man gets close, their snake tail grabs
    them and drags them to the ocean floor. Captured men are said to become Ramia's
    food or slaves, but since none have ever returned, it's unclear which is true.
    They are dangerous, but many men still wish to see one just once.
  summonDesc: Don't I look good?<br>Take me with you and I<br>promise to treat you
    right.
  fusionDesc: Oh, is this a tribute to me?<br>So sweet, now how should I<br>reward
    you?
